<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Computer Programming Portfolio</p>

        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Hi, I’m {{portfolio.name}}.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-text mt-4">
          I am a Computer Programming student at Georgian College with an interest
          in web development, software design, database systems, and practical
          programming solutions.
        </p>

        <p class="hero-text">
          I enjoy building responsive websites, structured applications, and
          projects that solve real-world problems through clean and maintainable code.
        </p>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">
          <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">View My Projects</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">Contact Me</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="profile-card">
          <img src="/images/profile.jpg" alt="Portrait of Vishal Malhotra" class="profile-photo">

          <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-2">{{portfolio.name}}</h2>

          <p class="mb-3">
            {{portfolio.role}}
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            Building skills in JavaScript, Node.js, Express, databases,
            and responsive web application development.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
      <p class="eyebrow">What I Am Building</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Developing practical programming skills</h2>
      <p class="section-text mx-auto" style="max-width: 760px;">
        My portfolio highlights my progress as a Computer Programming student
        and shows how I am learning to design, build, and improve software
        applications for real users.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="info-card h-100">
          <h3>Web Development</h3>
          <p>
            I am learning to build responsive websites and web applications using
            HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express, HBS, and Bootstrap.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="info-card h-100">
          <h3>Software Development</h3>
          <p>
            My studies are helping me strengthen programming logic,
            problem-solving, debugging, and application development skills.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="info-card h-100">
          <h3>Database Systems</h3>
          <p>
            I am interested in building data-driven applications that can store,
            manage, retrieve, and display information clearly and efficiently.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section pt-0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="highlight-box">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <h2 class="section-title">Focused on becoming a job-ready developer</h2>
          <p class="section-text mb-0">
            Through my Computer Programming program and personal practice, I am
            building a strong foundation in front-end development, back-end
            development, database concepts, and software project structure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Learn More About Me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>